%% PRD-024: ScenarioFlowRuntimeActor states
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Running: StartFlow
    Running --> Running: ContinueFrom(executionNodeId)
    Running --> WaitingForUserInput: WaitForInput node
    Running --> WaitingForDomainEvent: AwaitEvent node
    Running --> Completed: Output reached
    Running --> Failed: error / maxAttempts
    WaitingForUserInput --> Running: ResumeWithUserInput
    WaitingForDomainEvent --> Running: ResumeWithDomainEvent
    WaitingForUserInput --> Failed: timeout / cancel
    WaitingForDomainEvent --> Failed: timeout / cancel
    Completed --> Idle: new StartFlow replaces run
    Failed --> Idle: explicit reset
